*Proof.* By cases on the constructors, or by the matching clause of consistency or entailment. □


**Theorem (`pairRFinset_empty`).** The set of right children empty of the empty set is empty.

*Proof.* By cases on the constructors, or by the matching clause of consistency or entailment. □


**Theorem (`pairRFinset_insert_atom`).** Inserting the indicated constructor updates set of right children insert atom by adding that payload.

*Proof.* By cases on the constructors, or by the matching clause of consistency or entailment. □


