**Definition (`treeBot`).** The bottom tree token is the least informative token.


**Theorem (`mem_atomFinset`).** A token lies in the mem atom finite set exactly when a matching constructor in the set contributes it.

*Proof.* By cases on the constructors, or by the matching clause of consistency or entailment. □


